{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "af2b92056ca31a7220990e54bbd1bbedbc57bc2b4f1144bf07985981269a0793",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3d90b82960e424d79de5069e127a4a9ce9ceaf11fbcfd6b51b561451d69d6386",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nSlippy-Slide\nSkates",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26802906d6fae720addcbabb17f94232186398ed86d9b994eb76631010deb867",
      "text": "Wukong watched them glide.\n“Look! Flying feet!”\n“I want to try!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac77aa109e6927cad2833c5b03316965e227ac149a4b105256c308b306778d34",
      "text": "He put on his skates.\nClomp. Clomp.\n“My feet have tiny sleds!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d96eaf73c5861cfda4e1a2f9b099669c61b7937adfddc37e32d1abba39328019",
      "text": "Helmet on. Mittens on.\nCoach Otter checked\nhis skates.\n“Ready for little steps?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "292f92c6dd6959496cc2d2d49227b2cb7afa1b653ae923c96de78f9250aa55d5",
      "text": "Wukong stepped onto the ice.\nHis feet slid apart.\n“Wait for me, feet!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5850185b4eb03e24c120d46efbddcd62fd4f143c8e41589d01df8fcf87d9d0de",
      "text": "Whoops! Down he went.\nHis bottom met the ice.\n“Hello, chilly floor.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "695e7a41b6b8f1d1f0530c76f5a863312154cbef9d1383b236dd42d8f93cd4a0",
      "text": "“Learning takes practice,”\nsaid Coach Otter.\n“Let’s get up together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ba196ea8605dc60de79c4e6d7242a4779a302975ceeffbab0f8ba5c080099d39",
      "text": "Little steps. Bent knees.\n“Like a penguin!” said Rabbit.\nWukong waddled and giggled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff16772d0d6f1530b6f70b4e0d0d96cca2cca6b4dc3a9b49e545324f9873ee35",
      "text": "Push… glide.\nPush… glide.\nOne tiny slide!\nThen another.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "262b6a6131bd281ca45b258dae998abb21dbef42d471aed27b935514e8df1a23",
      "text": "Then came another tumble.\n“I thought I had it.”\nHe sat beside Pigsy.\n“Rest with me,” said Pigsy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ab5c3993b3e767166aaa02fd93fbd6ea27907ecf35d1bae282c99efb18054cac",
      "text": "They warmed their paws.\nThey watched\nthe swirling snow.\n“I’ll try again,” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b73ee03bbef2af1ff757738a13cb4326cf37bec7a68af6614a14cc54c128b412",
      "text": "He came back to practice.\nA little step. A little glide.\nWobbles and all.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3390d37107c3231b35850261fd01e9b61bcab88da87952502c7de873f9afbf68",
      "text": "Then his feet found a rhythm.\nPush… glide.\nPush… glide.\n“Look! I’m doing it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "471a9c0092f61833e61b72770733fa00514fb81bff7d7b62ec3ba1a35dd371e0",
      "text": "They made a gentle circle.\nRabbit led. Pigsy followed.\nWukong glided along.\nSix happy skates!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27f90a9ccabc244d060e91c62e2162a359caba21d21654c89ac9d12974075728",
      "text": "The rink lights twinkled.\n“See you soon, ice!”\nHis feet were tired.\nHis smile was not.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dad84c41b933378719ba51f00507eef34046539d2dadb77a12c757d578c4c2bb",
      "text": "Wukong curled under his quilt.\nIn his dreams,\nhe glided past the stars.\nSlowly. Softly.\nAll the way to sleep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a545cb385ff2736a96bcf41b2c72b43669ca35b648ed8b0d9425c42479df3fda",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
